---
import Badge from "../components/Badge.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Home" description="Home page" showMarquee={true}>
    <Section title="Welcome">
        <p>
            Hello and welcome to my gay lil website! I will be talking about
            many many things of various topics such as: Aim theory/Aim training,
            Urban planning/design, Architecture, Politics and Military bs. If
            you have any sort of interest in ANY of these topic you should STAY
            and VIEW MY SITE. (This is a threat :3). This site was made in Astro
            with the help of <a href="https://equinoxx.dev">Equinoxx</a> :3!
            Hopefully it will be expanded on in the future because right now
            like... The gallery and projects pages just don't do anything and
            might not for awhile who knows?
        </p>
    </Section>
    <Section title="About me!">
        <p>
            Mreowdy meow my name is Bebsi! Im a trans-fem furry on the internet
            :3c. I have a WIDE range of interests from military tactics to urban
            planning. I also listen to a lot of music and I am the embodiment of
            "I listen to anything". I peaked at 68,000 songs in my liked
            playlist on Spotify but sadly had to remove all songs due to my
            phone being unable to open Spotify TwT. Music is a big part of me
            and I'm always listening to something whether that's jungle,
            hyper-pop, punk, metal, rock and even country. I also play video
            games! (I mean who doesn't). I play multiplayer shooters such as:
            The Finals, Deadlock, Stalzone and Wardogs. I also play single
            player games: RimWorld, Project Zomboid, Voices of the Void and the
            Combat Mission games specifically Black Sea and Shock Force 2. I
            love aim training in KovaaK's and I am currently grinding{" "}
            <a href="https://evxl.app/u/Certifiedbatgirl/Viscose%20Benchmarks%20S2/Medium?tab=charts">
                viscose benchmark v2
            </a>
            . I specialise in tracking but want to branch out to other areas of
            aim.
        </p>
    </Section>
    <Section slot="before-footer">
        <div id="badge-box">
            <Badge
                src="/88x31/bebsi.png"
                label="Me :3c"
                href="https://bebsi-cat.github.io"
            />
            <Badge
                src="/88x31/blahaj_certified.png"
                label="equinoxx.dev"
                href="https://equinoxx.dev"
            />
            <Badge
                src="/88x31/kiiatto.png"
                label="kiiatto.net"
                href="https://kiiatto.net"
            />
            <Badge src="/88x31/a97.png" label="" />
            <Badge
                src="/88x31/e-scp.gif"
                label="Secure Contain Protect"
                href="https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com"
            />
            <Badge src="/88x31/g22.gif" label="Mlp :3" />
            <Badge src="/88x31/lapfoxgrad.gif" label="Lapfox my goat" />
            <Badge src="/88x31/nowar.png" label="Slava ukraine" />
            <Badge src="/88x31/flag-pan.png" label="" />
            <Badge src="/88x31/queerbtn.png" label="" />
            <Badge src="/88x31/therian.png" label="Fuck humanity!" />
            <Badge
                src="/88x31/hrt-e2.gif"
                label="Certified by a trans girl btw"
            />
            <Badge
                src="/88x31/lastfm-01.png"
                label="Check out my music taste"
                href="https://www.last.fm/user/Mochathefloof"
            />
        </div>
    </Section>
</Layout>
<style>
    #badge-box {
        display: flex;
        gap: var(--section-gap);
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    p {
        margin: 30px;
        text-align: justify;
    }
</style>
